description: Katalon Studio & Groovy Clean POM standards
globs: Keywords/**/*.groovy,Scripts/**,Test Cases/**
---

# Katalon Studio & Groovy Standards

1. **Path Conventions:** All Page Classes in `Keywords/<namespace>/pages/*.groovy`. All test scripts in `Scripts/**`.
2. **Zero Raw Locators in Scripts:** Test cases call Keyword Page methods. No raw XPaths or inline `findTestObject` in test cases.
3. **Dynamic Smart Waits:** Use `WebUI.waitForElementVisible()`; prohibit `Thread.sleep()`.
4. **Idempotency:** Dynamic test codes (`AUTO_` + timestamp) paired with Teardown.
